 ennemis diff\u00e9rents, chacun avec un style de jeu unique.<\/em><\/p>\n<p><span class=\"photoZoomWrapper\"><span class=\"imageWrapper\"><img src=\"https:\/\/rdsimages.cookieless.ca\/polopoly_fs\/1.6414996!\/img\/httpImage\/image.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>Last Year: The Nightmare<\/em><\/strong><em>\u00a0sera disponible sur PC cet automne, en exclusivit\u00e9 sur Discord pendant 90 jours au prix de CDN$34.99. Autres plateformes, dont Steam, au d\u00e9but 2019. \u00bb<\/em><\/p>\n<p><em><span class=\"photoZoomWrapper\"><span class=\"imageWrapper\"><img src=\"https:\/\/rdsimages.cookieless.ca\/polopoly_fs\/1.6414997!\/img\/httpImage\/image.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Le d\u00e9veloppeur qu\u00e9b\u00e9cois Elastic Games d\u00e9voile la premi\u00e8re bande-annonce de son jeu d\u2019horreur et de survie\u00a0Last Year: The Nightmare. \u00ab Soir d\u2019Halloween. 1996. Un groupe d\u2019adolescents se sont retrouv\u00e9s pris au pi\u00e8ge d\u2019un sombre et tordu reflet de leur ville habituellement endormie de Forest Hills.\u00a0Alors qu\u2019ils traversent le campus de leur \u00e9cole d\u2019East Side, ils\u2026<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":12,"featured_media":2754,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":[],"categories":[6],"tags":[851,182,852,849,850,108,31,318],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v18.0 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/une-premiere-bande-annonce-pour-le-jeu-quebecois-last-year-the-nightmare\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"fr_CA\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Une premi\u00e8r